{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果下一代iPhone Air 2和標準版iPhone 18的相機凸起部分可能明顯加厚。消息來源稱，相關計算機輔助設計文件顯示，iPhone Air 2將配備兩顆並排設置的後置攝像頭，相機凸起厚度約為3.8毫米，較現款機型的3.45毫米有所增加，但機身厚度仍將保持在5.6毫米。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587854.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T15:43:57.808112+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T15:24:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:17.177898+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T15:37:17.177898+00:00","content_hash":"658232d38e8d066268f1cc42b8e29434d994d30e4609c74d7c0f8e3b09d40bf8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}